{"urn": "hymni-homerici.fragmenta-hymni-in-bacchum", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "1", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "οἳ μὲν γὰρ Δρακάνῳ σʼ, οἳ δʼ Ἰκάρῳ ἠνεμοέσσῃ"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.fragmenta-hymni-in-bacchum", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "2", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "φάσʼ, οἳ δʼ ἐν Νάξῳ, δῖον γένος, εἰραφιῶτα,"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.fragmenta-hymni-in-bacchum", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "3", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "οἳ δέ σʼ ἐπʼ Ἀλφειῷ ποταμῷ βαθυδινήεντι"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.fragmenta-hymni-in-bacchum", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "4", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "κυσαμένην Σεμέλην τεκέειν Διὶ τερπικεραύνῳ·"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.fragmenta-hymni-in-bacchum", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "5", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἄλλοι δʼ ἐν Θήβῃσιν, ἄναξ, σε λέγουσι γενέσθαι,"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.fragmenta-hymni-in-bacchum", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "6", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ψευδόμενοι· σὲ δʼ ἔτικτε πατὴρ ἀνδρῶν τε θεῶν τε"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.fragmenta-hymni-in-bacchum", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "7", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "πολλὸν ἀπʼ ἀνθρώπων, κρύπτων λευκώλενον Ἥρην."}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.fragmenta-hymni-in-bacchum", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "8", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἔστι δέ τις Νύση, ὕπατον ὄρος, ἀνθέον ὕλῃ,"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.fragmenta-hymni-in-bacchum", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "9", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "τηλοῦ Φοινίκης, σχεδὸν Αἰγύπτοιο ῥοάων,"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.fragmenta-hymni-in-bacchum", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "10", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "<milestone type=\"startquote\"/>καί οἱ ἀναστήσουσιν ἀγάλματα πόλλʼ ἐνὶ νηοῖς."}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.fragmenta-hymni-in-bacchum", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "11", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ὣς δὲ τὰ μὲν τρία, σοὶ πάντως τριετηρίσιν αἰεὶ"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.fragmenta-hymni-in-bacchum", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "12", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἄνθρωποι ῥέξουσι τεληέσσας ἑκατόμβας.<milestone type=\"endquote\"/>"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.fragmenta-hymni-in-bacchum", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "13", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἦ καὶ κυανέῃσιν ἐπʼ ὀφρύσι νεῦσε Κρονίων·"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.fragmenta-hymni-in-bacchum", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "14", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἀμβρόσιαι δʼ ἄρα χαῖται ἐπερρώσαντο ἄνακτος"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.fragmenta-hymni-in-bacchum", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "15", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "κρατὸς ἀπʼ ἀθανάτοιο· μέγαν δʼ ἐλέλιξεν Ὄλυμπον."}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.fragmenta-hymni-in-bacchum", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "16", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ὣς εἰπὼν ἐπένευσε καρήατι μητίετα Ζεύς."}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.fragmenta-hymni-in-bacchum", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "17", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ἵληθʼ, εἰραφιῶτα, γυναιμανές· οἱ δέ σʼ ἀοιδοὶ"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.fragmenta-hymni-in-bacchum", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "18", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "ᾄδομεν ἀρχόμενοι λήγοντές τʼ· οὐδέ πῃ ἔστι"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.fragmenta-hymni-in-bacchum", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "19", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "σεῖʼ ἐπιληθομένῳ ἱερῆς μεμνῆσθαι ἀοιδῆς."}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.fragmenta-hymni-in-bacchum", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "20", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "καὶ σὺ μὲν οὕτω χαῖρε, Διώνυσʼ εἰραφιῶτα,"}
{"urn": "hymni-homerici.fragmenta-hymni-in-bacchum", "edition": "perseus-grc2", "locus": "21", "source": "perseus", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "σὺν μητρὶ Σεμέλῃ, ἥν περ καλέουσι Θυώνην."}
